<title>HONG KONG: Hysan Development 1996 net up 10.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Hysan Development 1996 net up 10.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 131.0    vs  122.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  72.0     vs  68.0</p>
<p>    Net			  1,349.04 vs  1,225.02</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		   2,218.16 vs  1,963.68</p>
<p>    Company name	     Hysan Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		April 24-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 May 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Hysan Development is a property investment and development company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 112 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 40 cents) vs 105 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
